      "title": "gawr gura (casual)",
      "excerpt": "The 2nd [[official alternate costume|costume]] of [[hololive English|hololive EN]]'s [[Gawr Gura]].\r\n\r\nGetting a casual look, she now wears a [[white shirt]] with [[short sleeves|short]] [[frilled sleeves]] worn under a blue [[skirt set]] with [[suspenders]], a [[blue skirt|blue]] [[buttons|buttoned]] [[miniskirt]], [[sandals]], and a shark-themed [[handbag]]. She also has [[cat ears]] with this attire.\r\n\r\nFor her [[official alternate hairstyle|official hairstyle]], she wears her hair in a [[side ponytail]] decorated with [[cube hair ornament|cube ornaments]].\r\n\r\nh4. Appearance\r\n\r\n* !post #4507379: Profile",
